{"id":"6967b79fb2644c98","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-interpretation.md","title":"Interpretation","display":"df-interpretation — Interpretation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-interpretation","aliases":["88-df-interpretation"],"display":"df-interpretation — Interpretation","depends_on":["[[88-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-interpretation — Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-interpretation-—-Interpretation-$\\mathcal{M}$\">df-interpretation — Interpretation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> (candidate coded structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-structure predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Interpretation}_S(\\mathcal{M})\">\\(\\mathrm{Interpretation}_S(\\mathcal{M})\\)</span> (interpretation predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpretation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Interpretation}_S(\\mathcal{M}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal{M})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpretation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Interpretation}_S(\\mathcal{M}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal{M})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span> : 解释/结构（将形式语言中的符号赋予具体意义, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> : 论域（语言所指称的对象集合, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c^{\\mathcal{M}}\">\\(c^{\\mathcal{M}}\\)</span> : 常量<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>的解释 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{\\mathcal{M}}\">\\(f^{\\mathcal{M}}\\)</span> : 函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>的解释 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^{\\mathcal{M}}\">\\(P^{\\mathcal{M}}\\)</span> : 谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>的解释 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>解释是形式语言的语义基础：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使公式获得真值</li>\n<li>使项获得指称对象</li>\n<li>使句子成为关于具体对象的陈述</li>\n</ul>\n<p>例子：标准算术解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{N}\">\\(\\mathcal{N}\\)</span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>论域：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^{\\mathcal{N}} = 0\">\\(0^{\\mathcal{N}} = 0\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{\\mathcal{N}}(n) = n + 1\">\\(S^{\\mathcal{N}}(n) = n + 1\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a>：解释定义的语义对象</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a>：在解释下公式的真值</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>：在某解释下都真的句子集合</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-interpretation-—-Interpretation-$\\mathcal{M}$","text":"df-interpretation — Interpretation $\\mathcal{M}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal M$ (candidate coded structure, see [[88-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M}$ : 解释/结构（将形式语言中的符号赋予具体意义, see [[88-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-